>> The Bioconductor build still shows the vignette as OK, most likely
>> because the build machines keep BiocFileCache between runs, so
>> buildGtoPdbDb(rerun = FALSE) finds a cached copy and never downloads.
>> r-universe starts from an empty cache every time, so it hits the 401. I'd
>> expect the Bioconductor build to fail too once that cache is refreshed.
